{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_001", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 7, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_001.png", "used_for": "区分 safety 与 security", "target_section": "1.1", "caption_draft": "Lecture 对 AI safety 与 AI security 的区分：前者强调系统对外部环境造成的伤害，后者强调系统自身被攻击、被利用或被接管。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_002", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 12, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_002.png", "used_for": "解释 agentic hybrid system", "target_section": "1.2", "caption_draft": "Agentic system 不是单个模型，而是把神经组件、符号组件、外部世界和用户交互组合成一个 hybrid/compound system。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_003", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 27, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_003.png", "used_for": "解释 LLM 输出如何进入攻击链", "target_section": "2.1", "caption_draft": "LLM 输出的五种下游用途：展示给用户、作为后续模型输入、作为分支条件、作为函数调用参数、作为可执行代码。每一类都可能成为新的攻击面。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_004", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 31, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_004.png", "used_for": "SQL injection attack chain", "target_section": "2.1", "caption_draft": "把传统 SQL injection 放入 agentic pipeline 后，恶意输入不必直接到达数据库，也可能通过 LLM 生成的 query 或 tool 参数间接触发。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_005", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 36, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_005.png", "used_for": "RCE attack chain", "target_section": "2.1", "caption_draft": "Remote code execution 在 hybrid system 中的危险更大，因为模型输出可能被包装成脚本、命令或调用参数后继续执行。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_006", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 39, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_006.png", "used_for": "direct prompt injection", "target_section": "2.2", "caption_draft": "直接 prompt injection 的基本模式：攻击者把恶意指令直接塞进模型可读的同一 prompt 空间，迫使系统 prompt 与用户内容发生竞争。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_007", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 48, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_007.png", "used_for": "indirect prompt injection", "target_section": "2.2", "caption_draft": "间接 prompt injection 的关键问题不是单条恶意指令，而是把外部数据与命令混在同一上下文中，破坏 data/command 边界。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_008", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 49, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_008.png", "used_for": "prompt injection attack surface", "target_section": "2.2", "caption_draft": "Prompt injection attack surface 不只来自用户输入，还包括 memory poisoning、knowledge base poisoning、external data poisoning 和 supply-chain 污染。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_009", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 52, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_009.png", "used_for": "LLM eval vs agent eval", "target_section": "3.1", "caption_draft": "Lecture 强调 stand-alone LLM evaluation 与 end-to-end agentic hybrid system evaluation 的根本差异。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_010", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 56, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_010.png", "used_for": "AgentXploit motivation", "target_section": "3.1", "caption_draft": "AgentXploit 的问题设定：商业 agents 往往是 black-box，攻击者只能通过外部数据源和任务反馈来诱导系统失控。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_011", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 58, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_011.png", "used_for": "AgentXploit core workflow", "target_section": "3.2", "caption_draft": "AgentXploit 的 fuzzing-based red teaming workflow：从种子指令出发，变异、投喂、观察反馈、更新种子库。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_012", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 61, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_012.png", "used_for": "AgentXploit evaluation", "target_section": "3.2", "caption_draft": "AgentXploit 在 AgentDojo 与 VWA-adv 上的结果表明，系统级红队需要考虑 attack success rate、transferability 和 component ablation。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_013", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 65, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_013.png", "used_for": "defense principles", "target_section": "4.1", "caption_draft": "Lecture 给出的三条总原则：defense-in-depth、least privilege/privilege separation，以及 safe-by-design / secure-by-design / provably secure。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_014", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 68, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_014.png", "used_for": "defense mechanisms overview", "target_section": "4.1", "caption_draft": "从 harden models 到 formal verification 的八层 defense mechanisms，说明 agentic security 不能依赖单点 guardrail。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_015", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 75, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_015.png", "used_for": "least privilege on tool call", "target_section": "4.2", "caption_draft": "Least privilege 在 agent 中的落点不是抽象原则，而是每一次 tool call 前的 policy generation、enforcement 与 compliance check。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_016", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 79, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_016.png", "used_for": "Progent overview", "target_section": "4.2", "caption_draft": "Progent 的核心是 DSL + policy enforcement framework：在不改 agent 内部推理逻辑的前提下，对工具权限做细粒度、可编程的运行时控制。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_017", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 84, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_017.png", "used_for": "Progent evaluation", "target_section": "4.2", "caption_draft": "Progent 的评测目标不是把 agent 变成静态沙箱，而是在 utility 下降可控的情况下显著降低 attack success rate。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_018", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 89, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_018.png", "used_for": "privilege separation", "target_section": "4.3", "caption_draft": "Privilege separation 在 agentic system 中意味着把不同任务拆到不同 agent 或 sandbox 中，每个组件只拥有完成其职责所需的最小权限。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_019", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 90, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_019.png", "used_for": "Privtrans", "target_section": "4.3", "caption_draft": "Privtrans 代表了更传统但仍然重要的系统安全思想：把高权限 monitor 与低权限 slave 分离，缩小可信基（trusted computing base）。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_020", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 93, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_020.png", "used_for": "DataSentinel", "target_section": "4.4", "caption_draft": "DataSentinel 把 prompt injection detection 建模成对抗者与防御者之间的 minimax game，目标是提升对 adaptive attacks 的检测能力。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_021", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 97, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_021.png", "used_for": "formal verification", "target_section": "4.4", "caption_draft": "Provably secure agent systems 的目标是对系统行为给出 specification-level 保证，而不是只靠经验性的 prompt 调整。", "source_unit_ids": []}
{"figure_id": "lec12_fig_022", "source_type": "slide", "source_ref": {"url": "https://rdi.berkeley.edu/adv-llm-agents/slides/dawn-agentic-ai.pdf", "page": 98, "timestamp": null}, "asset_path": "figures/lec12_fig_022.png", "used_for": "lecture conclusion", "target_section": "5", "caption_draft": "Lecture 的结尾结构：攻击、评测、原则和机制必须同时存在，才能让 agentic AI 的安全边界真正落地。", "source_unit_ids": []}
